      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Live Events Target Audiences",
      "Anchor": "live-events-target-audiences",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "With Target Audiences, you can now specify a country, region, or language along with your Organization\u0027s Live Events posts. Target Audiences is available for use with Company Pages only. To implement target audiences, there will be a few key changes to your user workflow.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Live Events Target Audiences",
      "Anchor": "live-events-target-audiences",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Register the Live Event.\nIngest RTMP(s) content.\nNEW Identify countries, regions, and languages to target. Use the geoTypeahead service to allow members to search for countries or regions. Refer to ISO-639 for a list of supported langauges.\nNEW Create a Post with a list of countries, regions, and languages to target to share your Live Event with your LinkedIn network.\nEnd the Live Event.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo Typeahead",
      "Anchor": "geo-typeahead",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Geo Typeahead"
      ],
      "Text": "The Bing Geo Typeahead API will provide a list of corresponding Geo URNs given a user input search query. The display name represents the user-friendly representation of the country or region, while the entity represents the URN that will be appended to the ugcPost.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
