    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Audience Counts",
      "Anchor": "audience-counts",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts"
      ],
      "Text": "With the Audience Counts API, you can forecast the reach of your target audience. Use the Audience Counts API to ensure your target audience contains at least 300 followers.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Field Name",
        "Description"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "active",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Active audience count for the given targeting criteria. Active audience includes members that are more likely to visit LinkedIn sites.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "total",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Total audience count for the given targeting criteria. To protect member privacy, this value is 0 when the audience size is less than 300. The total is a rounded approximation, and the degree of approximation depends upon the size of the audience segment.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "The following TargetingCriteria can be used with your request. See here for more information about Targeting Criteria.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "TargetingCriteria",
        "Description"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "urn:li:adTargetingFacet:followedCompanies",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "include the Organization URN (urn:li:organization:3487269) here",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "urn:li:adTargetingFacet:interfaceLocales",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "include the list of Locales (urn:li:locale:en_US) here",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "urn:li:adTargetingFacet:locations",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "include the list of Location URNs (urn:li:geo:90000084) here",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "All API requests require the header: X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "To comply with Restli 2.0 format, all URNs must be URL encoded. For example, urn:li:skill:17 is URL encoded as urn%3Ali%3Askill%3A17.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Schema",
      "Anchor": "schema-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Schema"
      ],
      "Text": "Postman or similar API tools may not support URL encoding query parameters within the request. If you encounter the response: Invalid query parameters passed to request, please test your request using curl.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "API Request",
      "Anchor": "api-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "API Request"
      ],
      "Text": "This sample submits a request to the audienceCountsV2 service to find the audience size of Organization 5340951 under the Geo Location 90000084 and Interface Locale en_US.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "API Request",
      "Anchor": "api-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "API Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/audienceCountsV2?q=targetingCriteriaV2\u0026targetingCriteria=(include:(and:List((or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3AfollowedCompanies:List(urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A5340951))),(or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3Alocations:List(urn%3Ali%3Ageo%3A90000084))),(or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3AinterfaceLocales:List(urn%3Ali%3Alocale%3Aen_US))))))\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Parameters",
      "Anchor": "parameters-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Field Name",
        "Required",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "q",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "This field should always be targetingCriteriaV2",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "string",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "targetingCriteria",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "targetingCriteria object",
            "Links": [
              "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/shared/references/v2/ads/targeting-criteria"
            ],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Specifies the targeting criteria that the member should match.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Parameters",
      "Anchor": "parameters-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "For reference, the unencoded and encoded Targeting Criteria used in the sample request is provided below.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Encoded Targeting Criteria",
      "Anchor": "encoded-targeting-criteria",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters",
        "Encoded Targeting Criteria"
      ],
      "Text": "=(include:(and:List((or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3AfollowedCompanies:List(urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A5340951))),(or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3Alocations:List(urn%3Ali%3Ageo%3A90000084))),(or:(urn%3Ali%3AadTargetingFacet%3AinterfaceLocales:List(urn%3Ali%3Alocale%3Aen_US))))))",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Unencoded Targeting Criteria",
      "Anchor": "unencoded-targeting-criteria",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters",
        "Unencoded Targeting Criteria"
      ],
      "Text": "=(include:(and:List((or:(urn:li:adTargetingFacet:followedCompanies:List(urn:li:organization:5340951))),(or:(urn:li:adTargetingFacet:locations:List(urn:li:geo:90000084))),(or:(urn:li:adTargetingFacet:interfaceLocales:List(urn:li:locale:en_US))))))",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "JSON Representation",
      "Anchor": "json-representation",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters",
        "JSON Representation"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022targetingCriteria\u0022: {\n    \u0022include\u0022: {\n      \u0022and\u0022: [\n        {\n          \u0022or\u0022: {\n            \u0022urn:li:adTargetingFacet:followedCompanies\u0022: [\n              \u0022urn:li:organization:5340951\u0022\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \u0022or\u0022: {\n            \u0022urn:li:adTargetingFacet:interfaceLocales\u0022: [\n              \u0022urn:li:locale:en_US\u0022\n            ],\n            \u0022urn:li:adTargetingFacet:locations\u0022: [\n              \u0022urn:li:geo:90000084\u0022\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Parameters",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022elements\u0022: [\n    {\n      \u0022total\u0022: 420,\n      \u0022active\u0022: 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \u0022paging\u0022: {\n    \u0022count\u0022: 10,\n    \u0022start\u0022: 0,\n    \u0022links\u0022: []\n  }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
